  "query_preview": "..\nAn upper-level ridge over the western US will remain overhead \nthrough Thursday. Fair conditions are expected to persist.\n\nAn upper-level trough is expected to dig over Montana sometime\nbetween Friday and Saturday. Timing of the trough between the GFS\nand ECMWF is inconsistent, but increased cloud coverage, cooler \ntemperatures, and possible precipitation are expected this \nweekend.\n\n\nFORECAST CONFIDENCE & DEVIATIONS:\n- No changes were made from the NBM.\n\n- There is low confidence in precipitation chances this weekend.\n\nDON",
